   "lines": [
    "Jack Elliott came",
    "on from Philadel-",
    "-phia - just the",
    "same dear old",
    "absentminded fellow",
    "as ever. It is a",
    "relief to find some",
    "one not in love.",
    "Am bothered a",
    "little by what",
    "Doc calls an",
    "\"ephemeral fever\"."
   ],
